ADP downstream Terraform 1.9.8 security rebuild

Upstream: https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform
Commit: e044e569c5bc81f82e9a4d7891f37c6fbb0a8a10 (v1.9.8)

This binary contains downstream changes. The exact version remains 1.9.8 because
workspace saved-plan and state consumers explicitly require it. It is compiled
with Go 1.26.8 and the dependency/source compatibility changes in security.patch.

The patch upgrades vulnerable runtime libraries, adapts the S3 single-role
configuration to the new SDK representation, migrates OpenTelemetry gRPC hooks
to stats handlers, and corrects diagnostic formatting flagged by the new Go vet.
Test-only updates preserve literal diffs and validate the new telemetry scope
representation without dropping assertions. HCL and cty versions remain unchanged.

